In 2025, one of the most googled queries by Kenyan SME owners is: *“Why is digital marketing not working for my small business in Kenya?”* At the heart lies a critical yet fixable issue: **limited digital marketing expertise and poor analytics skills** [***Source: Digital 4 Africa***](https://fixitpr.co.ke/2025/05/23/the-rise-of-mobile-first-marketing-in-kenya/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)***.***

### **Why This Challenge Dominates Searches**

- A recent Nairobi‑based study revealed that **lack of digital media knowledge** is the greatest roadblock to growth in digital marketing, followed closely by limited budgets and outdated techniques [UON Biorepository](https://erepository.uonbi.ac.ke/handle/11295/103209?utm_source=chatgpt.com).
- Businesses capture less traffic and engagement because they don’t know how to interpret analytics or convert data into strategy [Digital 4 Africa](https://digital4africa.com/what-ails-the-marketing-efforts-of-smes-in-kenya/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[ UON Biorepository](https://erepository.uonbi.ac.ke/handle/11295/103209?utm_source=chatgpt.com).

