#### **2. Data‑Driven Campaigns & Strategy**

- Full audit of current digital presence (SEO, mobile experience, listings). Native mobile‑first optimization is critical, as over **90% of Kenyan internet use is mobile** [diligent technologies.africa](https://diligenttechnologies.africa/challenges-facing-digital-marketing-in-kenya/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[ Fixit PR](https://fixitpr.co.ke/2025/05/23/the-rise-of-mobile-first-marketing-in-kenya/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
