- The shift to **mobile‑first marketing** means optimizing for phone screens, SMS or WhatsApp campaigns, TikTok ads locally (especially in Nairobi) or SMS outreach in rural counties [Digital 4 Africa](https://www.reddit.com/r/Kenya/comments/10t6lo8?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
- Developing **digital literacy** empowers SMEs to adopt digital marketing as a strategic growth lever, not a one‑off effort.

